## MailApi

### Place a new Mail Baby order, generate invoice, and queue provisioning
## Place a new Mail Baby order, generate invoice, and queue provisioning
POST https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/mail/order
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

{
 "serviceType": "<number>",
 "coupon": "<string>",
 "comment": "<string>"
}


